experiment.prespecified:
Fixed 2026-11-19, before any zoo result was read (borg-reborn-rs#568, PR #687). Pilot (RULES 16); larger tiers
only after this gate and the owner. ctl is the shipped configuration (the switch off).
Gate:
- no config_error; one binary; each arm's value in borg.txt and in params-core.json of the death replays;
- every cell ends in death, turn_cap or borg_stopped; frozen-turn bursts classified and key outliers listed;
- death bundles reproduced.
Report per arm and per class, from every game's messages:
- deaths and causes, final level, deepest level; paired rescued and newly killed against ctl;
- "# Throwing painful object" and "# Attacking with weapon" notes per game; flasks of oil thrown, and the share that hit
  ("Your Flask of oil hits");
- throws at a unique ("Targeting <unique>" followed by a throw), and how the fight ended (the unique fled, died, or the Borg
  left or died);
- flasks left in the pack at death or at the cap, and games that ran out of flasks with a monster in view.
Flasks count as missiles only below CL15 and missile conservation applies above CL20; most of the effect is at DL1-3.
#686 (flasks valued in the town plan) is not in this specimen; the two together need a later run.
